              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Honeybee333"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great dressing and easy to make with things I already had. I made a smaller amount but used the same propotions. It had a little too much oil for my liking but that was an easy fix to add more vinegar. I didn't have fresh oregano so I used the dried, but my husband loved it. I also used white balsamic",
