            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "NancyT"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I make this all the time, but use lemon-infused olive oil and a little less oil (or more vinegar). It is great!! When I stir fry up a bunch of vegetables, I use this as a dressing along with parmesan cheese ~ Yum!",
            "datePublished": "2013-07-02T16:32:11.323Z"
