              "name": "MJ Hayes"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Tried this recipe out as a lighter alternative to store bought dressing. It was yummy! Used grape seed oil as opposed to olive oil and added basil, a bit of ginger, a little cayenne pepper and ground black pepper and sea salt. Definitely will try again. I even made enough to bottle up and use for my next salad.",
